<title>ITALY: Next Italian cabinet meeting due on March 27.</title>
<headline>Next Italian cabinet meeting due on March 27.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The next Italian cabinet meeting is due to be held on March 27, the cabinet office said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>A cabinet meeting has to be held to approve the forthcoming mini-budget.</p>
<p>Earlier Agriculture Minister Michele Pinto said he expected the mini-budget to be approved at a cabinet meeting on March 28.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
